# Alembic

Схема PostgreSQL для SOKOL. Конфиг: `../alembic.ini`, runner: `app.db.alembic_runner`.

```bash
cd sokol-backend
alembic current
alembic upgrade head
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe_change"
```

Baseline: `versions/20260930_0001_baseline_schema.py` — `Base.metadata.create_all`.
Подробности: [docs/DATA.md](../docs/DATA.md).
